# ShedOS ISO package list
#
# Almost everything installs transitively via shedos-meta's depends=(), which
# is auto-generated from packages/official/*.txt + packages/aur.txt +
# shedos-* by scripts/render-meta-depends.sh. Only live-boot essentials are
# listed explicitly here as a belt-and-braces guard against accidental edits
# to base.txt breaking the ISO.

base
linux
linux-firmware
mkinitcpio-archiso

# Bootloader + live-boot extras — required by mkarchiso's strict profile
# validation against bootmodes=('bios.syslinux' 'uefi.grub') in profiledef.sh.
# These resolve transitively through shedos-meta too, but mkarchiso checks
# the literal packages.x86_64 file before resolving dependencies, so they
# must appear explicitly here or the build aborts before squashfs.
syslinux
grub
memtest86+
memtest86+-efi
edk2-shell

shedos-meta
